<title>UK: Sole Brent turning wet clocked to Texaco - trade.</title>
<headline>Sole Brent turning wet clocked to Texaco - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The only physical Brent cargo turning wet on Wednesday went unclaimed and was clocked to Texaco, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo has been nominated a loading date June 19-21. --London newsroom, +44 171 542 8145</p>
